talogger.DeleteType.Fast</field></block></next></block></next></block></statement></block></statement></block></xml>","main.ts":"","README.md":"# Kick strength data logger\n\n[View full project on microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/projects/make-it-code-it/kick-strength-data-logger)\n\nTo code this project yourself, right click on the background of the workspace and choose ‘delete all blocks’, then follow the coding video below. You can find the `forever` and `on start` blocks in the `Basic` section.\n\n### What is it?\n\nUse your BBC micro:bit to improve your game by collecting sports science data on the strength of kicks or racket strokes.\n\n#### Introduction\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wCoDEYSLLmo\n\n#### Coding guide\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XrY6yE0qwfw\n\n### How it works\n\nThis project uses the micro:bit’s [accelerometer sensor](https://microbit.org/get-started/features/sensors/#accelerometer) and [data logging feature](https://microbit.org/get-started/features/data-logging/) to log and store data on how hard you kick a ball, or hit a racket, over a short period of time. You can then study the data on a computer to improve your consistency or performance over time, in the same way sports professionals use data science to help improve their performance.\n\nVisit the [projects page on microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/projects/make-it-code-it/) for a full description of this and other projects.","_locales/ar/README.md":"# Kick strength data logger\n\n[View full project on microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/ar/projects/make-it-code-it/kick-strength-data-logger)\n\nTo code this project yourself, right click on the background of the workspace and choose ‘delete all blocks’, then follow the coding video below. You can find the `forever` and `on start` blocks in the `Basic` section.\n\n### ماذا يعني؟\n\nUse your BBC micro:bit to improve your game by collecting sports science data on the strength of kicks or racket strokes.\n\n#### مقدمة \n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wCoDEYSLLmo\n\n#### دليل البرمجة\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XrY6yE0qwfw\n\n### كيف يعمل ؟\n\nThis project uses the micro:bit’s [accelerometer sensor](https://microbit.org/ar/get-started/features/sensors/#accelerometer) and [data logging feature](https://microbit.org/ar/get-started/features/data-logging/) to log and store data on how hard you kick a ball, or hit a racket, over a short period of time. You can then study the data on a computer to improve your consistency or performance over time, in the same way sports professionals use data science to help improve their performance.\n\nVisit the [projects page on microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/ar/projects/make-it-code-it/) for a full description of this and other projects.","_locales/ca/README.md":"# Registrador de dades de força de xut\n\n[View full project on microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/ca/projects/make-it-code-it/kick-strength-data-logger)\n\nTo code this project yourself, right click on the background of the workspace and choose ‘delete all blocks’, then follow the coding video below. You can find the `forever` and `on start` blocks in the `Basic` section.\n\n### En què consisteix?\n\nUtilitza la teva micro:bit de la BBC per millorar el teu joc recopilant dades de ciències esportives sobre la força dels xuts o de la raqueta.\n\n#### Introducció\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wCoDEYSLLmo\n\n#### Guia de programació\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XrY6yE0qwfw\n\n### Com funciona\n\nAquest projecte utilitza el [sensor de l'acceleròmetre](https://microbit.org/ca/get-started/features/sensors/#accelerometer) i la [funció de registre de dades](https://microbit.org/ca/get-started/features/data-logging/) de la micro:bit per registrar i emmagatzemar dades amb quina força xutes una pilota o colpeges una raqueta durant un curt període de temps. A continuació, pots estudiar les dades en un ordinador per millorar la  coherència o rendiment al llarg del temps, de la mateixa manera que els professionals de l'esport utilitzen la ciència de dades per ajudar a millorar el seu rendiment.\n\nVisit the [projects page on microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/ca/projects/make-it-code-it/) for a full description of this and other projects.","_locales/cy/README.md":"# Cofnodydd data cryfder cic\n\n[View full project on microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/cy/projects/make-it-code-it/kick-strength-data-logger)\n\nTo code this project yourself, right click on the background of the workspace and choose ‘delete all blocks’, then follow the coding video below. You can find the `forever` and `on start` blocks in the `Basic` section.\n\n### Beth yw e?\n\nDefnyddiwch eich BBC micro:bit i wella'ch gêm trwy gasglu data gwyddor chwaraeon ar gryfder ciciau neu ergydion raced.\n\n#### Cyflwyniad\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wCoDEYSLLmo\n\n#### Canllaw codio\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XrY6yE0qwfw\n\n### Sut mae'n gweithio\n\nMae'r prosiect hwn yn defnyddio [synhwyrydd cyflymromedr](https://microbit.org/cy/get-started/features/sensors/#accelerometer) a [ a nodwedd cofnodi data](https://microbit.org/cy/get-started/features/data-logging/) micro:bit i logio a storio data ar ba mor galed ydych chi'n cicio pêl, neu'n taro raced, dros gyfnod byr o amser. Yna gallwch chi astudio'r data ar gyfrifiadur i wella'ch cysondeb neu berfformiad dros amser, yn yr un modd mae mabolgampwyr proffesiynol yn defnyddio gwyddor data i helpu i wella eu perfformiad.\n\nVisit the [projects page on microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/cy/projects/make-it-code-it/) for a full description of this and other projects.","_locales/es-es/README.md":"# Registrador de datos de fuerza de patada\n\n[Ver proyecto completo en microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/es-es/projects/make-it-code-it/kick-strength-data-logger)\n\nPara codificar este proyecto tú mismo, haz clic derecho en el fondo del área de trabajo y elige ‘delete all blocks’, luego sigue el video de codificación a continuación. Puedes encontrar los bloques forever y on start en la sección Basic.  \n  \n\n\n### ¿Qué es?\n\nUtiliza tu BBC micro:bit para mejorar tu juego recopilando datos de la ciencia del deporte sobre la fuerza de los saques o los golpes de raqueta.\n\n#### Introducción\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wCoDEYSLLmo\n\n#### Guía de programación\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XrY6yE0qwfw\n\n### Cómo funciona\n\nEste proyecto utiliza el [sensor acelerómetro](https://microbit.org/es-es/get-started/features/sensors/#accelerometer) del micro:bit y [la función de registro de datos](https://microbit.org/es-es/get-started/features/data-logging/) para registrar y almacenar datos sobre la fuerza con la que pateas una pelota, o golpeas una raqueta, durante un corto período de tiempo. A continuación, puedes estudiar los datos en un ordenador para mejorar tu regularidad o rendimiento a lo largo del tiempo, del mismo modo que los profesionales del deporte utilizan la ciencia de datos para ayudar a mejorar su rendimiento.\n\nVisita la [página de proyectos en microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/es-es/projects/make-it-code-it/) para una descripción completa de este y otros proyectos.","_locales/fr/README.md":"# Enregistreur de données de force de tir\n\n[Voir le projet complet sur microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/fr/projects/make-it-code-it/kick-strength-data-logger)\n\nPour coder ce projet vous-même, cliquez avec le bouton droit de la souris sur l'arrière-plan de l'espace de travail et sélectionnez « Supprimer tous les blocs », puis suivez la vidéo de codage ci-dessous. Vous trouverez les blocs `forever (répéter indéfiniment)` et `on start (au démarrage)` dans la section `Basique`.\n\n### Qu'est-ce que c'est ?\n\nUtilisez votre BBC micro:bit pour améliorer votre jeu en collectant des données scientifiques sur la force des coups de pied ou des coups de raquette.\n\n#### Introduction\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wCoDEYSLLmo\n\n#### Guide de codage\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XrY6yE0qwfw\n\n### Comment ça marche\n\nCe projet utilise [l'accéléromètre](https://microbit.org/fr/get-started/features/sensors/#accelerometer) du micro:bit et [la fonctionnalité de sauvegarde des données](https://microbit.org/fr/get-started/features/data-logging/) pour enregistrer et stocker des données sur la difficulté de frapper une balle avec le pied ou avec une raquette, sur une courte période. Vous pouvez ensuite étudier les données sur un ordinateur afin d'améliorer votre régularité ou vos performances au fil du temps, de la même manière que les professionnels du sport utilisent la science des données pour améliorer leurs performances.\n\nVisitez la [page des projets sur microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/fr/projects/make-it-code-it/) pour une description complète de ce projet et bien d'autres.","_locales/ga-ie/README.md":"# Ciceáil neart logálaí sonraí\n\n[Féach ar an tionscadal iomlán ar microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/ga-ie/projects/make-it-code-it/kick-strength-data-logger)\n\nChun an tionscadal seo a chódú leat féin, cliceáil ar dheis ar chúlra an spáis oibre agus roghnaigh ‘scrios gach bloc’, ansin lean an físeán códaithe thíos. Is féidir leat na bloic `go deo` agus `ar thús` a fháil sa rannán `Bunúsach`.\n\n### Cad atá ann?\n\nBain úsáid as do BBC micro:bit chun do chluiche a fheabhsú trí shonraí eolaíocht spóirt a bhailiú ar neart ciceanna nó strócanna racéid.\n\n#### Intreoir\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wCoDEYSLLmo\n\n#### Treoir chódaithe\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XrY6yE0qwfw\n\n### Conas a oibríonn sé\n\nÚsáideann an tionscadal seo braiteoir luasmhéadair micro:bit [](https://microbit.org/ga-ie/get-started/features/sensors/#accelerometer) agus [gné logála sonraí](https://microbit.org/ga-ie/get-started/features/data-logging/) chun sonraí a logáil agus a stóráil ar cé chomh deacair is a dhéanann tú liathróid a chiceáil, nó a bhuaileann tú raicéad, thar thréimhse ghearr ama. Is féidir leat ansin staidéar a dhéanamh ar na sonraí ar ríomhaire chun do chomhsheasmhacht nó do fheidhmíocht a fheabhsú le himeacht ama, ar an mbealach céanna úsáideann gairmithe spóirt eolaíocht sonraí chun cabhrú lena bhfeidhmíocht a fheabhsú.\n\nTabhair cuairt ar an leathanach [tionscadal ar microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/ga-ie/projects/make-it-code-it/)le haghaidh cur síos iomlán ar an tionscadal seo agus ar thionscadail eile.","_locales/hr/README.md":"# Kick strength data logger\n\n[View full project on microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/hr/projects/make-it-code-it/kick-strength-data-logger)\n\nTo code this project yourself, right click on the background of the workspace and choose ‘delete all blocks’, then follow the coding video below. You can find the `forever` and `on start` blocks in the `Basic` section.\n\n### Što je to?\n\nUse your BBC micro:bit to improve your game by collecting sports science data on the strength of kicks or racket strokes.\n\n#### Uvod\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wCoDEYSLLmo\n\n#### Vodič za kodiranje\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XrY6yE0qwfw\n\n### Kako to radi\n\nThis project uses the micro:bit’s [accelerometer sensor](https://microbit.org/hr/get-started/features/sensors/#accelerometer) and [data logging feature](https://microbit.org/hr/get-started/features/data-logging/) to log and store data on how hard you kick a ball, or hit a racket, over a short period of time. You can then study the data on a computer to improve your consistency or performance over time, in the same way sports professionals use data science to help improve their performance.\n\nVisit the [projects page on microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/hr/projects/make-it-code-it/) for a full description of this and other projects.","_locales/ja/README.md":"# キック強度データロガー\n\n[表示: microbit\\.org のすべてのプロジェクト](https://microbit.org/ja/projects/make-it-code-it/kick-strength-data-logger)\n\nあなたのプロジェクトでプログラムを作成ために、ワークスペースの背景の上でマウスの右ボタンをクリックします。そして、「すべてのブロックを削除する」を選択しましょう。詳細は、プログラム紹介動画を参考にしてください。 あなたは、 `ずっと`と`最初だけ`の2種類のブロックを、`基本`セクションの中に見つけることができます。\n\n### 説明\n\nBBC micro:bitを使って、キックやラケットのストロークの強さに関するスポーツ科学データを収集し、試合を改善しましょう。\n\n#### はじめに\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wCoDEYSLLmo\n\n#### プログラミングガイド\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XrY6yE0qwfw\n\n### 動作の仕組み\n\nこのプロジェクトでは、micro:bitの [加速度センサー](https://microbit.org/ja/get-started/features/sensors/#accelerometer) と [データロギング機能](https://microbit.org/ja/get-started/features/data-logging/) を使用して短時間にボールを蹴ったりラケットを打ったりする強さに関するデータを記録して保存します。 その後、コンピュータ上のデータを調べて、時間の経過とともに一貫性やパフォーマンスを向上させることができます。 スポーツ専門家がデータサイエンスを使ってパフォーマンスを向上させるのと同じように\n\n訪問: [microbit\\.org にあるプロジェクトページ](https://microbit.org/ja/projects/make-it-code-it/) このプロジェクト、そして、他のプロジェクトのすべての説明","_locales/ko/README.md":"# 킥 강도 데이터 로거\n\n[View full project on microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/ko/projects/make-it-code-it/kick-strength-data-logger)\n\nTo code this project yourself, right click on the background of the workspace and choose ‘delete all blocks’, then follow the coding video below. You can find the `forever` and `on start` blocks in the `Basic` section.\n\n### 프로젝트 소개\n\nBBC micro:bit 를 사용해 킥이나 라켓 스트로크의 강도에 대한 스포츠 과학 데이터를 수집하여 게임 실력을 향상시켜 보세요.\n\n#### 소개\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wCoDEYSLLmo\n\n#### 프로그래밍 가이드\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XrY6yE0qwfw\n\n### 설명\n\n이 프로젝트에서는 micro:bit 의 [가속도계 센서](https://microbit.org/ko/get-started/features/sensors/#accelerometer)와 [데이터 로깅 기능](https://microbit.org/ko/get-started/features/data-logging/)을 사용하여 짧은 시간 동안 공을 차거나 라켓을 치는 강도에 대한 데이터를 기록하고 저장합니다. 그러면 스포츠 전문가들이 데이터 과학을 활용해 성과를 개선하는 것과 같은 방식으로, 컴퓨터에서 데이터를 연구해 일관성이나 성과를 시간이 지남에 따라 개선할 수 있습니다.\n\nVisit the [projects page on microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/ko/projects/make-it-code-it/) for a full description of this and other projects.","_locales/nl/README.md":"# Logger gegevens trap sterkte\n\n[Bekijk het volledige project op microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/nl/projects/make-it-code-it/kick-strength-data-logger)\n\nOm dit project zelf te programmeren, klik met de rechtermuisknop op de achtergrond van de werkruimte en kies 'verwijder alle blokken', en volg daarna de onderstaande codeer video. Je vindt de `de hele tijd` en `bij opstarten` blokken in de  ` Basis` categorie.\n\n### Wat is het?\n\nGebruik je BBC micro:bit om jouw spel te verbeteren door sportwetenschappelijke gegevens te verzamelen over de kracht van trappen of racketslagen.\n\n#### Inleiding\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wCoDEYSLLmo\n\n#### Codeer instructies\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XrY6yE0qwfw\n\n### Zo werkt het\n\nDit project maakt gebruik van de [acceleratie meter sensor](https://microbit.org/nl/get-started/features/sensors/#accelerometer) en [gegevens registratie functie](https://microbit.org/nl/get-started/features/data-logging/) van micro:bit om gegevens te loggen en op te slaan van hoe hard je in korte tijd tegen een bal schopt of een racket slaat. Vervolgens kan je de gegevens op een computer bestuderen om jouw consistentie of prestaties in de loop van de tijd te verbeteren, net zoals sportprofessionals datawetenschap gebruiken om hun prestaties te verbeteren.\n\nBezoek de [projectpagina op microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/nl/projects/make-it-code-it/) voor een volledige beschrijving van deze en andere projecten.","_locales/pl/README.md":"# Rejestrator danych o sile wyrzucenia\n\n[Zobacz pełny projekt na microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/pl/projects/make-it-code-it/kick-strength-data-logger)\n\nAby samemu zakodować ten projekt, kliknij prawym przyciskiem myszy na tle obszaru roboczego i wybierz \"usuń wszystkie bloki\", a następnie postępuj zgodnie z filmem o kodowaniu poniżej. Możesz znaleźć bloki `na zawsze` i `podczas uruchamiania` w kategorii (na liście) `Podstawowe`.\n\n### Co to jest?\n\nUżyj BBC micro:bit, aby ulepszyć swoją grę, zbierając dane z zakresu nauk sportowych na temat siły kopnięć lub uderzeń rakietą.\n\n#### Wprowadzanie\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wCoDEYSLLmo\n\n#### Przewodnik po kodowaniu\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XrY6yE0qwfw\n\n### Jak to działa\n\nTen projekt używa [czujnika akcelerometru](https://microbit.org/pl/get-started/features/sensors/#accelerometer) micro:bit oraz [funkcji rejestrowania danych](https://microbit.org/pl/get-started/features/data-logging/) do rejestrowania i przechowywania danych o tym, jak mocno kopniesz piłkę lub uderzysz rakietą, w krótkim czasie. Następnie możesz przeanalizować dane na komputerze, aby z czasem poprawić spójność lub wydajność, w ten sam sposób profesjonalni sportowcy wykorzystują dane do poprawy swoich wyników.\n\nOdwiedź stronę projektu [na microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/pl/projects/make-it-code-it/), aby uzyskać pełny opis tego i innych projektów.","_locales/pt-br/README.md":"# Registrador de dados de força do chute\n\n[View full project on microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/pt-br/projects/make-it-code-it/kick-strength-data-logger)\n\nTo code this project yourself, right click on the background of the workspace and choose ‘delete all blocks’, then follow the coding video below. You can find the `forever` and `on start` blocks in the `Basic` section.\n\n### O que é?\n\nDescubra se um número é ímpar ou par, um projeto Make it: Code it para o seu BBC micro:bit.\n\n#### Introdução\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wCoDEYSLLmo\n\n#### Código\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XrY6yE0qwfw\n\n### Como funciona:\n\nEste projeto utiliza o [sensor de acelerômetro](https://microbit.org/pt-br/get-started/features/sensors/#accelerometer) e [recurso de registro de dados](https://microbit.org/pt-br/get-started/features/data-logging/) do micro:bit para registrar e armazenar dados sobre a força com que você chuta uma bola ou bate em uma raquete, ao longo de um curto período de tempo. Você pode então analisar os dados em um computador para melhorar sua consistência ou desempenho ao longo do tempo, da mesma forma que os profissionais do esporte utilizam a ciência de dados para ajudar a melhorar seu desempenho.\n\nVisit the [projects page on microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/pt-br/projects/make-it-code-it/) for a full description of this and other projects.","_locales/pt-pt/README.md":"# Kick strength data logger\n\n[View full project on microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/pt-pt/projects/make-it-code-it/kick-strength-data-logger)\n\nTo code this project yourself, right click on the background of the workspace and choose ‘delete all blocks’, then follow the coding video below. You can find the `forever` and `on start` blocks in the `Basic` section.\n\n### O que é isto?\n\nUse your BBC micro:bit to improve your game by collecting sports science data on the strength of kicks or racket strokes.\n\n#### Introdução\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wCoDEYSLLmo\n\n#### Guia do código\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XrY6yE0qwfw\n\n### Como é que funciona\n\nThis project uses the micro:bit’s [accelerometer sensor](https://microbit.org/pt-pt/get-started/features/sensors/#accelerometer) and [data logging feature](https://microbit.org/pt-pt/get-started/features/data-logging/) to log and store data on how hard you kick a ball, or hit a racket, over a short period of time. You can then study the data on a computer to improve your consistency or performance over time, in the same way sports professionals use data science to help improve their performance.\n\nVisit the [projects page on microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/pt-pt/projects/make-it-code-it/) for a full description of this and other projects.","_locales/sr/README.md":"# Kick strength data logger\n\n[View full project on microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/sr/projects/make-it-code-it/kick-strength-data-logger)\n\nTo code this project yourself, right click on the background of the workspace and choose ‘delete all blocks’, then follow the coding video below. You can find the `forever` and `on start` blocks in the `Basic` section.\n\n### Шта је ово?\n\nUse your BBC micro:bit to improve your game by collecting sports science data on the strength of kicks or racket strokes.\n\n#### Увод\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wCoDEYSLLmo\n\n#### Водич за програмирање\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XrY6yE0qwfw\n\n### Како то ради\n\nThis project uses the micro:bit’s [accelerometer sensor](https://microbit.org/get-started/features/sensors/#accelerometer) and [data logging feature](https://microbit.org/get-started/features/data-logging/) to log and store data on how hard you kick a ball, or hit a racket, over a short period of time. You can then study the data on a computer to improve your consistency or performance over time, in the same way sports professionals use data science to help improve their performance.\n\nVisit the [projects page on microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/sr/projects/make-it-code-it/) for a full description of this and other projects.","_locales/zh-cn/README.md":"# 踢球力度记录器\n\n[View full project on microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/zh-cn/projects/make-it-code-it/kick-strength-data-logger)\n\nTo code this project yourself, right click on the background of the workspace and choose ‘delete all blocks’, then follow the coding video below. You can find the `forever` and `on start` blocks in the `Basic` section.\n\n### 它是什么？\n\n使用BBC micro:bit收集踢腿或挥拍的力度数据，提升您的比赛水平。\n\n#### 介绍\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wCoDEYSLLmo\n\n#### 编程指南\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XrY6yE0qwfw\n\n### 工作原理\n\n这个项目使用了micro:bit的[加速计](https://microbit.org/zh-cn/get-started/features/sensors/#accelerometer)和[数据记录功能](https://microbit.org/zh-cn/get-started/features/data-logging/)，记录下您在短时间内踢球或挥拍得多用力。 然后，您可以在电脑上研究这些数据，让动作发挥稳定，提高比赛表现，就像体育专业人士使用数据科学来帮助提升他们的表现一样。\n\nVisit the [projects page on microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/zh-cn/projects/make-it-code-it/) for a full description of this and other projects.","_locales/zh-tw/README.md":"# Kick strength data logger\n\n[View full project on microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/zh-tw/projects/make-it-code-it/kick-strength-data-logger)\n\nTo code this project yourself, right click on the background of the workspace and choose ‘delete all blocks’, then follow the coding video below. You can find the `forever` and `on start` blocks in the `Basic` section.\n\n### 它是什麼？\n\nUse your BBC micro:bit to improve your game by collecting sports science data on the strength of kicks or racket strokes.\n\n#### 介紹\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wCoDEYSLLmo\n\n#### 編程指引\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XrY6yE0qwfw\n\n### 運作方式\n\nThis project uses the micro:bit’s [accelerometer sensor](https://microbit.org/zh-tw/get-started/features/sensors/#accelerometer) and [data logging feature](https://microbit.org/zh-tw/get-started/features/data-logging/) to log and store data on how hard you kick a ball, or hit a racket, over a short period of time. You can then study the data on a computer to improve your consistency or performance over time, in the same way sports professionals use data science to help improve their performance.\n\nVisit the [projects page on microbit\\.org](https://microbit.org/zh-tw/projects/make-it-code-it/) for a full description of this and other projects.","pxt.json":"{\n    \"name\": \"kick strength data logger\",\n    \"description\": \"\",\n    \"dependencies\": {\n        \"core\": \"*\",\n        \"radio\": \"*\",\n        \"microphone\": \"*\",\n        \"datalogger\": \"*\"\n    },\n    \"files\": [\n        \"main.blocks\",\n        \"main.ts\",\n        \"README.md\",\n        \"_locales/ar/README.md\",\n        \"_locales/ca/README.md\",\n        \"_locales/cy/README.md\",\n        \"_locales/es-es/README.md\",\n        \"_locales/fr/README.md\",\n        \"_locales/ga-ie/README.md\",\n        \"_locales/hr/README.md\",\n        \"_locales/ja/README.md\",\n        \"_locales/ko/README.md\",\n        \"_locales/nl/README.md\",\n        \"_locales/pl/README.md\",\n        \"_locales/pt-br/README.md\",\n        \"_locales/pt-pt/README.md\",\n        \"_locales/sr/README.